note_tweet.text:
Sunday celebrating Brandeis Camp Institute's (BCI) 85th birthday with a massive brunch, reconnecting with friends, singing and Israeli folk dancing. I remember all the steps. Miserlou, anyone?

Jewish camping and collegiate experiences are core to building lifelong Jewish identity and pride. We need these now more than ever.  More pics in comments. Brandeis is a glorious, hidden gem 30 minutes from LA.

@AmericanJewishU

